# The comparison's tasks (docs/40-testing.md §9) as a fixed sequence, for
# the Kario half's numbers that need no person: frame times, key to screen,
# cold starts (tools/android-compare/kario-half.sh runs it through the kit's
# perf step, tools/perf/host.sh --play on this machine). The same keys a
# person presses in the timed run, except the last key of a task that would
# reach outside the phone (the call, the SMS): the dial task stops before
# the call key, the SMS is erased. Scanning to pay is left out: the
# scanner and the payment confirmation are system overlays, which a step
# cannot wait for; it is timed by video only.
# The Shell starts it from the idle screen with no screen lock; every app
# starts cold (the Shell is started afresh for each run).

wait sys.idle 90000
sleep 1000

# Dial: smart dialling from the idle screen (94 finds Zhang San), the
# first match focused; the timed run then presses the call key.
type 94
wait com.phone.dialer/ 10000
key down
sleep 500
key f4
wait sys.idle

# SMS: a new message to a number, three characters of 9-key pinyin
# (wo dao le), then erased: no SMS goes out, no draft is left.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open messages
wait com.phone.messages/list 10000
key f2
wait com.phone.messages/new
type 13800000000
key down
type 96
key enter
type 326
key enter
type 53
key enter
key backspace 6
key up
key backspace 11
key esc
wait com.phone.messages/list
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Chat: the first conversation in Hongyan, a reply of two characters
# (hao de) sent; the demo server's reply comes back by push.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open chat
wait com.phone.chat/list 10000
key enter
wait com.phone.chat/chat: 10000
type 42633
key enter
key enter
sleep 2000
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Camera: opened from the main menu, the viewfinder left running.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open camera
wait com.phone.camera/ 10000
sleep 3000
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Pay: only Feiqian's start (the scan is timed by video).
key enter
wait sys.menu
open wallet
wait com.phone.wallet/ 10000
sleep 1000
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Scroll: the contacts list, 30 rows down and back with the Down key.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open contacts
wait com.phone.contacts/list 10000
key down 30
key up 30
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Switch: Messages, Hongyan and Contacts opened again (warm) in this order,
# the three apps used last, Contacts in front; each time the one used
# longest ago is brought back with the task switcher (F3, the third row,
# OK).
key enter
wait sys.menu
open messages
wait com.phone.messages/ 10000
key f4
wait sys.idle
key enter
wait sys.menu
open chat
wait com.phone.chat/ 10000
key f4
wait sys.idle
key enter
wait sys.menu
open contacts
wait com.phone.contacts/ 10000
key f3
wait sys.tasks
key down 2
key enter
wait com.phone.messages/
key f3
wait sys.tasks
key down 2
key enter
wait com.phone.chat/
key f3
wait sys.tasks
key down 2
key enter
wait com.phone.contacts/
key f4
wait sys.idle
